{"words": [{"text": "فَبِمَا", "translation": "So for"}, {"text": "نَقْضِهِم", "translation": "their breaking"}, {"text": "مِّيثَـٰقَهُمْ", "translation": "(of) their covenant"}, {"text": "لَعَنَّـٰهُمْ", "translation": "We cursed them"}, {"text": "وَجَعَلْنَا", "translation": "and We made"}, {"text": "قُلُوبَهُمْ", "translation": "their hearts"}, {"text": "قَـٰسِيَةًۭ ۖ", "translation": "hard"}, {"text": "يُحَرِّفُونَ", "translation": "They distort"}, {"text": "ٱلْكَلِمَ", "translation": "the words"}, {"text": "عَن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "مَّوَاضِعِهِۦ ۙ", "translation": "their places"}, {"text": "وَنَسُوا۟", "translation": "and forgot"}, {"text": "حَظًّۭا", "translation": "a part"}, {"text": "مِّمَّا", "translation": "of what"}, {"text": "ذُكِّرُوا۟", "translation": "they were reminded"}, {"text": "بِهِۦ ۚ", "translation": "of [it]"}, {"text": "وَلَا", "translation": "And not"}, {"text": "تَزَالُ", "translation": "will you cease"}, {"text": "تَطَّلِعُ", "translation": "to discover"}, {"text": "عَلَىٰ", "translation": "of"}, {"text": "خَآئِنَةٍۢ", "translation": "treachery"}, {"text": "مِّنْهُمْ", "translation": "from them"}, {"text": "إِلَّا", "translation": "except"}, {"text": "قَلِيلًۭا", "translation": "a few"}, {"text": "مِّنْهُمْ ۖ", "translation": "of them"}, {"text": "فَٱعْفُ", "translation": "But forgive"}, {"text": "عَنْهُمْ", "translation": "them"}, {"text": "وَٱصْفَحْ ۚ", "translation": "and overlook"}, {"text": "إِنَّ", "translation": "Indeed"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "يُحِبُّ", "translation": "loves"}, {"text": "ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ", "translation": "the good-doers"}], "sahih": "So for their breaking of the covenant We cursed them and made their hearts hardened. They distort words from their [proper] places [i.e., usages] and have forgotten a portion of that of which they were reminded.1 And you will still observe deceit among them, except a few of them. But pardon them and overlook [their misdeeds]. Indeed, Allāh loves the doers of good."}